title Vinyl: the output muted at 480x320 (the volume group under the output button: the mark and "Mute") and 320x480 (the group in the bottom row: the mark alone, large), their real density; the muted look (dark, white)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 610
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_MUTED 1

wait 1200
shot 01-now-muted
expect esc
expect notext "60"
# the muted box as drawn (qa-info.txt's muted= line is read from these lines and the app's own log of the box)
@480x320 expect text "Mute"
@320x480 expect notext "Mute"
expect notext "Muted"
expect notext "Off"
wait 300
shot 02-now-muted-volume
# "-" while muted does nothing
@480x320 tapxy 0.550 0.609
@320x480 tapxy 0.486 0.928
wait 300
@480x320 expect text "Mute"
expect notext "60"
# "+" brings the sound back at its level
@480x320 tapxy 0.875 0.609
@320x480 tapxy 0.848 0.928
wait 300
shot 03-now-unmuted
expect notext "Mute"
expect text "60"
expect noquit
